  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "微型創業入門",
    "sub_ename": "MICRO-ENTREPRENEURSHIP",
    "describe_ch": "企業製造產品後，會產生部份的下腳料，而下腳料有些是可再利用的。下腳料未經妥善處理，會對地球環境造成沉重負擔。本課程以永續發展目標(SDGs)--目標12「負責任的消費與生產基礎」為焦點，主要建置在再生材料，或企業下腳料的活化再應用，實踐永續再生的循環價值，藉此基礎進一步形成新的永續微型創業商業模式。本課程內容涵蓋學習永續未來趨勢，永續再生產品構思，綠色消費行為，關鍵跨領域下腳料資源的整合與應用，蒐集資訊及挖掘問題，並找尋可能的解決方案，提出永續微型創業計畫書。",
    "describe_eh": "After a company manufactures a product, it will produce some tailings, and some of the tailings can be reused. If tailings are not properly disposed of, they will cause a heavy effect on the earth's environment. This course focuses on the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) - Goal 12 Basic of Responsible Consumption and Production and based on this foundation to further form a new sustainable micro-entrepreneurship business model. The content of this course covers learning sustainable future trends, the conception of sustainable renewable products, green consumption behaviors, integration and application of key cross-field tailings resources, collecting information and mining problems, finding possible solutions, and proposing a sustainable micro-entrepreneurship plan.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
